SUMMARY:Soldering Skill Share @ Orchard Park
DESCRIPTION:Splat Space - Durham's Hackerspace\nAdam is hosting a Solderin
 g Skill Share this Sunday as a part of Comrades in the Commons\, a monthly
  "community disaster preparedness festival for all ages" in Orchard Park\,
  Durham\, NC
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/splatspace/events/315096633/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260604T014210Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260604T014210Z
